                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "45d698e5-7af7-4fb9-88a4-fa5932db801c",
                                "sense_id": "9fbe13f0-a895-3f92-8b14-7cf89577b525",
                                "text": "Опре́лости возника́ют в результа́те постоя́нного тре́ния и поте́ния э́тих уча́стков ко́жи, причём нере́дко они́ осложня́ются како́й-либо инфе́кцией, осо́бенно вы́званной грибка́ми Candida.",
                                "translation": "Intertrigo occurs as a result of constant friction and perspiration of these parts of the skin, being not uncommon it becomes complex with an infection, in particular, Candida, which is caused by funguses",
                                "english": "Intertrigo occurs as a result of constant friction and perspiration of these parts of the skin, being not uncommon it becomes complex with an infection, in particular, Candida, which is caused by funguses"
                            }
                        ]
